<% const seed=ff_briefing(),sources=ff_briefing_sources(),entries=sources.flatMap(source=>(seed.sources[source.id]?.items||[]).map(item=>({...item,source}))).sort((a,b)=>b.publishedAt.localeCompare(a.publishedAt)); %>
<section class="briefing-page" data-briefing data-feed-url="<%= url_for('/briefing/feed.json') %>">
  <script type="application/json" data-briefing-seed><%- JSON.stringify(seed).replaceAll('<','\\u003c') %></script>
  <header class="briefing-heading">
    <div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR DAILY WINDOW</span><h1>每日看板<span class="briefing-heading-dot" aria-hidden="true">.</span></h1><p>世界消息，和你关心的市场。听着歌，慢慢看。</p></div>
    <div class="briefing-today"><time data-briefing-date><%= date(new Date(),'MM月DD日') %></time><span>国内外要闻 · AI · 市场</span><a href="<%= url_for('/music/') %>">去音乐馆，选一首背景音乐 ↗</a></div>
  </header>
  <%- partial('markets') %>
  <div class="briefing-topline"><p data-briefing-status role="status">已载入 <%= entries.length %> 条来源记录，正在检查更新…</p><div><button type="button" class="text-button" data-briefing-refresh>检查更新</button><button type="button" class="text-button" data-briefing-read-all>本次列表标为已读</button></div></div>
  <div class="briefing-layout">
    <div class="briefing-main">
      <nav class="briefing-categories" aria-label="资讯分类"><% for(const [key,label] of [['all','全部'],['general','综合要闻'],['ai','AI 动态'],['radar','Codex 雷达'],['dev','开发工具'],['security','安全阅读']]) { %><button type="button" data-briefing-category="<%= key %>" aria-pressed="<%= key==='all' %>"><%= label %></button><% } %></nav>
      <div class="briefing-filterbar"><label class="search-field"><span aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input type="search" data-briefing-search placeholder="搜模型、公司或关键词" aria-label="搜索资讯" maxlength="120"></label><div class="briefing-read-filters" role="group" aria-label="阅读状态"><button type="button" data-briefing-mode="all" aria-pressed="true">全部</button><button type="button" data-briefing-mode="unread" aria-pressed="false">未读</button><button type="button" data-briefing-mode="saved" aria-pressed="false">收藏</button></div></div>
      <p class="briefing-results" data-briefing-results aria-live="polite">最新记录</p>
      <div class="briefing-feed" data-briefing-feed><% for(const [index,item] of entries.slice(0,12).entries()) { %><article class="briefing-item"><div class="briefing-item-index"><%= String(index+1).padStart(2,'0') %></div><div class="briefing-item-body"><div class="briefing-item-meta"><span><%= item.source.label %></span><span><%= item.source.name %></span><time datetime="<%= item.publishedAt %>"><%= date(item.publishedAt,'MM.DD') %></time></div><h2><a href="<%= item.url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= item.title %> ↗</a></h2><% if(item.summary) { %><p><%= item.summary %></p><% } %></div></article><% } %></div>
      <p class="empty-state" data-briefing-empty hidden>这里暂时没有匹配的消息。换个分类，或清除关键词试试。</p>
      <button type="button" class="briefing-more" data-briefing-more hidden>再看 12 条 ↓</button>
      <noscript><p class="briefing-note">当前为随站点发布的快照。开启 JavaScript 后可检查新资讯、筛选与保存阅读状态。</p></noscript>
    </div>
    <aside class="briefing-aside" aria-label="订阅与来源设置">
      <section class="briefing-panel"><div class="briefing-panel-title"><div><span class="eyebrow">MAKE IT YOURS</span><h2>我的订阅</h2></div></div><div class="briefing-subscriptions"><% for(const source of sources) { %><label><input type="checkbox" data-briefing-source="<%= source.id %>" checked><span><%= source.label %></span></label><% } %></div>
        <div class="briefing-notification"><button type="button" class="button" data-briefing-notify>开启桌面提醒</button><p data-briefing-notify-status class="briefing-note">网页保持打开时提醒新消息；关闭网页后不会推送。</p></div><p class="briefing-note" data-briefing-storage>未读、收藏、自选与订阅偏好保存在当前浏览器。</p>
      </section>
      <details class="briefing-panel briefing-source-panel"><summary>消息从哪里来</summary><div class="briefing-source-details"><span class="eyebrow">SOURCES & FRESHNESS</span><h2>消息从哪里来</h2><div data-briefing-sources><% for(const source of sources) { %><div class="briefing-source"><a href="<%= source.home %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><%= source.name %> ↗</a><p><%= source.note %></p></div><% } %></div><p class="briefing-note">这里呈现来源报道与订阅记录，保留出处及日期。Codex 雷达为第三方观察，不代表你的个人额度。</p></div></details>
    </aside>
  </div>
</section>
